    "title": "Opinion | Romer: State ballot issues and the trouble with easy answers - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chris Romer ,\n5 hours ago Colorado voters will face 14 statewide ballot measures on our November ballot. Absorbing this much policy is challenging amid campaign advertisements, candidate mailers, aggressive television ads and frequent unsolicited text messages. The ballot addresses taxation, education, criminal justice, immigration, energy and election rules. Some proposals are straightforward, while others appear... Read full article",
